    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Ranch</strong><br>Start with a small patch of land and turn it into a thriving dragon ranch. Place paddocks, feeding stations, storage sheds, and more. Each building has a purpose\u2014and every upgrade helps your dragons grow stronger and happier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dragon Eggs</strong><br>Venture beyond your ranch into a vibrant, mysterious world full of hidden secrets. From misty mountains to sunlit valleys, each region holds unique dragon eggs waiting to be found. Explore at your own pace, follow clues, and uncover the ancient legacy of dragons long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch and Care for Your Dragons</strong>Bring your discoveries home and carefully hatch each dragon egg in a safe, warm environment. Every dragon is unique\u2014some are shy, others bold, and each requires your attention and trust. Feed them, clean them, keep them healthy, and watch as your bond grows over time.<br><strong>The better you care for your dragons, the greater the rewards you\u2019ll receive in return.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Open World</strong><br>Wander through a vibrant world reclaimed by nature. From hidden groves to ancient ruins, every area holds secrets to uncover and dragon eggs to find. Take your time, follow your curiosity, and uncover the forgotten stories left behind in a peaceful forgotten land.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Ranch</strong><br>Start with a small patch of land and turn it into a thriving dragon ranch. Place paddocks, feeding stations, storage sheds, and more. Each building has a purpose\u2014and every upgrade helps your dragons grow stronger and happier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Dragon Eggs</strong><br>Venture beyond your ranch into a vibrant, mysterious world full of hidden secrets. From misty mountains to sunlit valleys, each region holds unique dragon eggs waiting to be found. Explore at your own pace, follow clues, and uncover the ancient legacy of dragons long forgotten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch and Care for Your Dragons</strong>Bring your discoveries home and carefully hatch each dragon egg in a safe, warm environment. Every dragon is unique\u2014some are shy, others bold, and each requires your attention and trust. Feed them, clean them, keep them healthy, and watch as your bond grows over time.<br><strong>The better you care for your dragons, the greater the rewards you\u2019ll receive in return.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a Colorful Open World</strong><br>Wander through a vibrant world reclaimed by nature. From hidden groves to ancient ruins, every area holds secrets to uncover and dragon eggs to find. Take your time, follow your curiosity, and uncover the forgotten stories left behind in a peaceful forgotten land.</p>",
    "short_description": "A dragon ranching sim where you find, hatch, raise, and care for your dragons while building a home in a ruined world. Breed dragons, explore the land, and grow your ranch in this cozy creature care adventure.",
